claim into question.</i>

548
00:36:58.490 --> 00:37:00.368
God, why did I do that?

549
00:37:00.410 --> 00:37:02.402
It's all right.

550
00:37:04.210 --> 00:37:06.281
- Keep your hand elevated.
- Okay.

551
00:37:06.330 --> 00:37:07.889
- Just keep it up.
- Yeah.

552
00:37:07.930 --> 00:37:09.842
We'll call you
from the hospital.

553
00:37:09.890 --> 00:37:11.927
Benny,
you're man of the house.

554
00:37:11.970 --> 00:37:14.610
And I want those alpacas
back in the barn by 10:00.

555
00:37:14.650 --> 00:37:16.084
- You got it, Dad.
- 10:00!

556
00:37:28.050 --> 00:37:30.121
What are we gonna do?

557
00:37:30.170 --> 00:37:33.481
I don't know.
You're the man of the house.

558
00:37:33.530 --> 00:37:37.285
Come on, Jack-Jack.
Time for bed.

559
00:37:37.330 --> 00:37:41.119
Benny will look after us
because he's so responsible.

560
00:37:41.170 --> 00:37:42.240
Race you upstairs.

561
00:38:32.130 --> 00:38:34.281
Come on.
Come on.

562
00:38:35.650 --> 00:38:37.323
Come on.

563
00:39:07.130 --> 00:39:09.520
Benny?

564
00:39:09.570 --> 00:39:12.768
Benny, get your stupid ass
out here now!

565
00:39:14.450 --> 00:39:15.520
Fuck.
What?

566
00:39:15.570 --> 00:39:16.946
You were supposed
to feed the alpacas.

567
00:39:16.970 --> 00:39:18.689
I already did.

568
00:39:18.770 --> 00:39:21.010
What are you talking about?
They're standing right there.

569
00:39:23.690 --> 00:39:25.249
I already fed them.

570
00:39:25.290 --> 00:39:27.441
- Well...
- What the...?

571
00:39:27.490 --> 00:39:29.686
Get them into the barn, okay?

572
00:39:29.770 --> 00:39:32.808
And lay off the weed,
all right?

573
00:39:32.850 --> 00:39:34.682
I can't fucking do this
on my own, okay?

574
00:39:34.770 --> 00:39:35.770
- Go.
- Okay.

575
00:39:35.771 --> 00:39:37.205
Go!
Just do it already!

576
00:39:37.250 --> 00:39:39.481
Harpy. Harridan.
Hairy ax wound.

577
00:39:39.530 --> 00:39:41.328
Maggot dick.

578
00:39:41.770 --> 00:39:43.409
Jeez.

579
00:39:43.450 --> 00:39:44.566
Hey, girl.

580
00:39:48.290 --> 00:39:51.442
Come on, girl.

581
00:39:55.850 --> 00:39:57.204
Jack?

582
00:40:12.130 --> 00:40:12.890
What are you doing?

583
00:40:12.891 --> 00:40:14.483
Shh!

584
00:40:14.530 --> 00:40:17.090
It's talking
to me.

585
00:40:17.130 --> 00:40:19.247
Who?
Who's talking to you?

586
00:40:19.290 --> 00:40:21.885
The man in the well.

587
00:40:23.570 --> 00:40:25.448
Okay.

588
00:41:18.170 --> 00:41:19.889
Dad?
Hello?

589
00:41:21.530 --> 00:41:22.680
Dad?

590
00:41:25.850 --> 00:41:26.850
Hello?

591
00:41:29.490 --> 00:41:31.447
Hello?
Lavinia?

592
00:41:31.490 --> 00:41:33.163
Is that you?

593
00:43:51.330 --> 00:43:52.906
<i>A weather report
for Arkham County,</i>

594
00:43:52.930 --> 00:43:55.650
<i>Innsmouth, Aylesbury,
Dunwich, Kingsport...</i>

595
00:43:55.690 --> 00:43:57.886
<i>Low temperature
around 54 degrees.</i>

596
00:43:57.930 --> 00:44:00.047
<i>High near...</i>

597
00:44:31.690 --> 00:44:34.330
Don't puke.
Don't puke.

598
00:45:30.530 --> 00:45:31.566
Dad?

599
00:46:11.090 --> 00:46:12.410
Lavinia, hey.

600
00:46:12.450 --> 00:46:15.807
Um, this really isn't
a good time.

601
00:46:15.850 --> 00:46:17.762
Are you guys okay?

602
00:46:17.810 --> 00:46:19.961
Um, no,
I'm not feeling too well.

603
00:46:20.010 --> 00:46:21.285
All right, well,

604
00:46:21.330 --> 00:46:23.322
that's actually what I want to
talk to you about.

605
00:46:23.370 --> 00:46:25.146
I think there's something wrong
with the water here,

606
00:46:25.170 --> 00:46:26.010
some kind of contamination.

607
00:46:26.011 --> 00:46:28.809
Sorry, what?

608
00:46:30.810 --> 00:46:33.962
A contamination
with the... the water.

609
00:46:34.010 --> 00:46:36.066
Um, I don't know exactly what.

610
00:46:36.090 --> 00:46:38.346
But, um, we're sending a sample
back to the lab in Arkham.

611
00:46:38.370 --> 00:46:39.426
In the meantime...

612
00:46:39.450 --> 00:46:41.009
I believe it, science guy.

613
00:46:41.050 --> 00:46:43.770
Hey, try not to drink
the water, okay?

614
00:47:09.530 --> 00:47:12.489
Hey, kiddo.
What are you up to?

615
00:47:12.530 --> 00:47:14.840
Playing with my friends.

616
00:47:18.850 --> 00:47:21.649
Okeydokey.
Well, um, have fun, okay?

617
00:47:59.890 --> 00:48:01.609
Ezra?

618
00:48:04.610 --> 00:48:05.930
Ezra?

619
00:48:11.850 --> 00:48:13.000
Ezra?

620
00:48:24.530 --> 00:48:26.647
Hey, make yourself
comfortable, amigo.

621
00:48:26.690 --> 00:48:28.522
What the hell
are you doing down there?

622
00:48:28.570 --> 00:48:30.766
I'm reorganizing.

623
00:48:32.650 --> 00:48:35.848
- Oh, want some java?
- Uh, no, thank you.

624
00:48:35.890 --> 00:48:38.007
That's actually what I wanted
to talk to you about.

625
00:48:38.050 --> 00:48:40.121
I don't think
you should be drinking that.

626
00:48:40.170 --> 00:48:42.765
I found something in the water.
Just a trace, really.

627
00:48:42.810 --> 00:48:44.767
Um... Hey, where's G-spot?

628
00:48:44.810 --> 00:48:46.563
Heh!
Who knows?

629
00:48:46.610 --> 00:48:48.920
Caterwauling out there
somewhere.

630
00:48:48.970 --> 00:48:51.530
Really haven't seen her
since it all started.

631
00:48:51.570 --> 00:48:52.845
Since what all started?

632
00:48:52.890 --> 00:48:55.041
Shh!

633
00:48:55.090 --> 00:48:56.410
You can hear them down there.

634
00:48:58.170 --> 00:49:00.127
H-Hear them?
Hear who?

635
00:49:12.850 --> 00:49:14.523
Yeah, I could hear them
while I slept,

636
00:49:14.570 --> 00:49:17.244
