Comet, steady.
Be steady.

1020
01:24:47.930 --> 01:24:50.684
Steady.

1021
01:24:50.770 --> 01:24:53.205
Jesus, Benny, you nearly
gave me a heart attack.

1022
01:24:53.250 --> 01:24:54.969
Com, steady.
Come on.

1023
01:24:55.010 --> 01:24:56.586
- Comet...
- What's wrong with the horse?

1024
01:24:56.610 --> 01:24:57.986
There's nothing wrong
with the horse.

1025
01:24:58.010 --> 01:25:00.066
Right now Comet is the last
thing you need to be afraid of.

1026
01:25:00.090 --> 01:25:03.561
Fuck!
No, Comet.

1027
01:25:03.610 --> 01:25:05.090
Fuck.

1028
01:25:10.210 --> 01:25:12.930
Looks like we're gonna
have to walk out of here.

1029
01:25:12.970 --> 01:25:14.370
In the dark?

1030
01:25:14.410 --> 01:25:16.606
Through 12 miles
of ancient woodland?

1031
01:25:28.890 --> 01:25:31.610
What are you doing?
We have to get out of here.

1032
01:25:31.650 --> 01:25:32.986
Sam, is that you?

1033
01:25:33.010 --> 01:25:34.967
Benny.
Benny!

1034
01:25:36.010 --> 01:25:37.330
Fuck!

1035
01:25:39.130 --> 01:25:40.166
He sounds hurt.

1036
01:25:45.250 --> 01:25:46.650
Hold on, boy!

1037
01:25:46.690 --> 01:25:48.886
- What are you doing?
- We can't just leave him.

1038
01:25:48.930 --> 01:25:50.808
Are you out of
your fucking mind?

1039
01:25:50.850 --> 01:25:52.330
I have to, all right?

1040
01:25:52.370 --> 01:25:54.226
I'll put him in the bucket,
and then you can pull him up.

1041
01:25:54.250 --> 01:25:56.082
No, Benny...

1042
01:25:56.130 --> 01:25:58.486
- Whoa! Whoa.
- Fuck this.

1043
01:25:58.530 --> 01:26:01.090
No, give me your hand.
It is just a dog.

1044
01:26:01.130 --> 01:26:03.411
- Please give me your hand.
- It's gonna take two minutes.

1045
01:26:05.250 --> 01:26:07.242
Idiot.

1046
01:26:09.810 --> 01:26:11.085
Benny!

1047
01:26:11.970 --> 01:26:13.484
God, jeez.

1048
01:26:13.530 --> 01:26:16.204
Smells like something died
down here.

1049
01:26:21.690 --> 01:26:23.124
Sam?

1050
01:26:23.170 --> 01:26:25.287
Come on!

1051
01:26:27.370 --> 01:26:29.327
I-I can see him moving.

1052
01:26:29.370 --> 01:26:30.626
What is it?
What do you see?

1053
01:26:37.210 --> 01:26:38.644
No!
No, no, no!

1054
01:26:38.690 --> 01:26:39.965
No!

1055
01:26:50.930 --> 01:26:52.159
Benny!

1056
01:26:52.210 --> 01:26:55.089
No!

1057
01:26:55.130 --> 01:26:57.008
No.

1058
01:26:57.050 --> 01:26:58.279
Aah!

1059
01:26:58.330 --> 01:27:01.607
I have been looking all over
for you!

1060
01:27:01.650 --> 01:27:03.881
You expect me to do
everything on my own, huh?

1061
01:27:03.930 --> 01:27:04.690
The both of you.

1062
01:27:04.691 --> 01:27:05.919
I mean, whatever happened

1063
01:27:05.970 --> 01:27:08.565
to the good old-fashioned
concept of teamwork?!

1064
01:27:08.610 --> 01:27:10.602
If we could all just
pull together

1065
01:27:10.650 --> 01:27:12.369
just once
for the sake of your mother.

1066
01:27:12.410 --> 01:27:16.245
Daddy!
You're hurting me!

1067
01:27:17.850 --> 01:27:21.639
Honey.
Honey, I'm not that.

1068
01:27:21.690 --> 01:27:24.888
No, I'm not a monster.

1069
01:27:24.930 --> 01:27:28.002
I know I'm not my dad.
I know.

1070
01:27:28.050 --> 01:27:30.929
Please don't make me
go in there.

1071
01:27:33.090 --> 01:27:37.130
I promise.
I'll do whatever you want.

1072
01:27:45.650 --> 01:27:48.245
I'll even
clean up my room.

1073
01:27:50.970 --> 01:27:55.169
Well, it's like I said,
Lavinia.

1074
01:27:55.210 --> 01:27:57.088
- We're a family.
- No.

1075
01:27:57.130 --> 01:28:01.807
Now, if there's one thing that
families do, they stay together.

1076
01:28:01.850 --> 01:28:05.480
Now feed your mother.

1077
01:28:05.530 --> 01:28:07.249
Dad!

1078
01:28:08.650 --> 01:28:09.845
Please!

1079
01:28:11.090 --> 01:28:13.047
Please!

1080
01:28:14.810 --> 01:28:16.130
But, Dad!

1081
01:28:32.250 --> 01:28:34.401
You seeing this?

1082
01:28:34.450 --> 01:28:36.009
Wait,
is that Lavinia's horse?

1083
01:29:03.450 --> 01:29:06.249
I put
your favorite movie on.

1084
01:29:07.450 --> 01:29:09.840
I know this one by heart.

1085
01:29:09.890 --> 01:29:11.466
<i>You have a little something
in your eyes, you know?</i>

1086
01:29:11.490 --> 01:29:12.450
<i>Oh.</i>

1087
01:29:12.451 --> 01:29:17.889
I think
after Roman Colosseum...

1088
01:29:19.650 --> 01:29:23.166
...we should go Corsica,

1089
01:29:23.210 --> 01:29:27.409
Malta, Greek Isles.

1090
01:29:28.890 --> 01:29:30.961
Greek Isles are the best.

1091
01:29:33.050 --> 01:29:35.963
Dad!

1092
01:29:36.010 --> 01:29:39.082
Please!

1093
01:29:52.450 --> 01:29:54.646
Lavinia!

1094
01:29:57.850 --> 01:29:59.682
Lavinia!

1095
01:29:59.770 --> 01:30:01.887
Lavinia!

1096
01:30:16.130 --> 01:30:17.405
You never know.

1097
01:30:26.330 --> 01:30:27.525
Mr. Gardner?

1098
01:30:29.810 --> 01:30:31.449
Lavinia?

1099
01:30:31.490 --> 01:30:33.402
- Oh, shit.
- What?

1100
01:30:41.130 --> 01:30:44.965
It's you.
Toxologist.

1101
01:30:45.010 --> 01:30:46.524
I'm the hydrologist, sir,
yeah.

1102
01:30:46.570 --> 01:30:49.483
Um, we came to make sure
you're okay.

1103
01:30:49.530 --> 01:30:50.964
That's very kind of you.

1104
01:30:51.010 --> 01:30:53.684
We've been having a hard time,
you know?

1105
01:30:53.770 --> 01:30:58.481
The car and telephone
and Wi-Fi.

1106
01:30:58.530 --> 01:31:00.886
Heh.
Life in the sticks.

1107
01:31:00.930 --> 01:31:02.523
Come in.

1108
01:31:02.570 --> 01:31:04.926
Theresa will be happy
to see you.

1109
01:31:04.970 --> 01:31:07.565
I'm hungry!

1110
01:31:10.050 --> 01:31:12.770
I'm hungry.

1111
01:31:12.810 --> 01:31:15.325
Mom. Mom.

1112
01:31:15.370 --> 01:31:18.204
- Mommy!
- I'm hungry.

1113
01:31:20.690 --> 01:31:21.885
What happened to your arms?

1114
01:31:21.930 --> 01:31:23.967
It's just a rash.

1115
01:31:28.050 --> 01:31:29.404
Where's your wife?

1116
01:31:31.530 --> 01:31:33.010
She's right there.

1117
01:31:43.370 --> 01:31:45.168
And the rest
of your family?

1118
01:31:45.210 --> 01:31:48.840
Everybody's here.
We all stick together.

1119
01:31:50.050 --> 01:31:52.007
What?

1120
01:31:52.050 --> 01:31:56.681
Theresa says,
"Except for Benny.

1121
01:31:56.770 --> 01:32:00.446
Benny lives
in the well now."

1122
01:32:05.450 --> 01:32:08.284
Drink?
I'm having one.

1123
01:32:08.330 --> 01:32:10.367
- Lavinia!
- Mom!

1124
01:32:13.010 --> 01:32:13.930
Lavinia!

1125
01:32:13.931 --> 01:32:15.285
Mom, stop!

1126
01:32:17.130 --> 01:32:18.803
Ward!

1127
01:32:18.850 --> 01:32:19.850
Out of the way.

1128
01:32:26.490 --> 01:32:28.209
No!

1129
01:32:28.250 --> 01:32:30.003
Please, Mommy!

1130
01:32:30.050 --> 01:32:31.848
No, no!

1131
01:32:56.130 --> 01:32:57.928
Daddy...

1132
01:33:07.330 --> 01:33:09.367
They're not my family.

1133
01:33:12.130 --> 01:33:13.325
Daddy...

1134
01:33:19.330 --> 01:33:22.528
Lavinia.
Lavinia! Lavinia.

1135
01:33:22.570 --> 01:33:23.686
Come here.

1136
01:33:26.010 --> 01:33:29.048
All right.
It's gonna be okay, all right?

1137
01:33:29.090 --> 01:33:31.286
You're gonna be okay.
I mean...

1138
01:33:31.330 --> 01:33:32.844
Fuck!
I'm gonna carry you.

1139
01:33:32.890 --> 01:33:34.866
I'm gonna carry you outside
in the patrol car, okay?

1140
01:33:34.890 --> 01:33:36.529
I got you.
Oh, God.

1141
01:33:39.570 --> 01:33:41.801
You're okay.

1142
01:33:41.850 --> 01:33:44.081
Okay, we're almost there.

1143
01:33:50.810 --> 01:33:52.642
The color.

1144
01:33:55.690 --> 01:33:56.690
Ward!

1145
01:33:58.810 --> 01:34:00.039
No!

1146
01:34:00.090 --> 01:34:01.365
Dad!

1147
01:34:05.410 --> 01:34:08.448
Fuck!
You shot my dad! Look!

1148
01:34:08.490 --> 01:34:10.561
Look what you did!

1149
01:34:12.810 --> 01:34:14.210
Dad.

1150
01:34:24.010 --> 01:34:25.842
Beautiful.

1151
01:34:27.210 --> 01:34:29.167
Like a flower.

1152
01:34:29.210 --> 01:34:30.929
It's gonna be okay, Dad, now.

1153
01:34:30.970 --> 01:34:34.247
You can help us.

1154
01:34:34.290 --> 01:34:37.203
Three Charlie one seven.
I've got a code 33.

1155
01:34:37.250 --> 01:34:39.242
D-Don't...

1156
01:34:39.290 --> 01:34:41.043
Don't...

1157
01:34:41.090 --> 01:34:43.969
Please don't leave me.

1158
01:34:47.250 --> 01:34:48.570
Daddy?

1159
01:34:50.650 --> 01:34:52.289
Daddy?

1160
01:34:55.890 --> 01:34:58.530
I'm not getting anything.
We've got to get out of here.

1161
01:34:58.570 --> 01:35:00.129
We're not
getting out of here.

1162
01:35:00.170 --> 01:35:02.560
None of us are.

1163
01:35:02.610 --> 01:35:06.286
That thing won't let us.

1164
01:35:06.330 --> 01:35:08.401
Come on, look, that...
that's silly.

1165
01:35:08.450 --> 01:35:10.146
There's nothing stopping us
from getting up and leav...

1166
01:35:15.410 --> 01:35:17.686
What the hell was that?

1167
01:35:17.770 --> 01:35:20.126
It sounded like it came
from Ezra's cabin.

1168
01:35:22.770 --> 01:35:24.026
We can't leave him out there
on his own.

1169
01:35:24.050 --> 01:35:25.609
Ward, give me a hand.

1170
01:35:27.610 --> 01:35:29.408
Lavinia.

1171
01:35:29.450 --> 01:35:31.203
I'm not going with you.

1172
01:35:33.050 --> 01:35:34.769
We've got to go.

1173
01:35:34.810 --> 01:35:37.609
I'm sorry, we've got to go.
You... You can't stay here.

1174
01:35:42.250 --> 01:35:43.969
I live here.

1175
01:35:48.410 --> 01:35:50.970
I'm gonna come back for you.

1176
01:35:51.010 --> 01:35:52.569
I'll be back.

1177
01:36:05.370 --> 01:36:07.202
<i>Nothing.</i>

1178
01:36:10.210 --> 01:36:14.841
<i>Nothing.
Nothing.</i>

1179
01:36:14.890 --> 01:36:17.166
<i>Nothing.</i>

1180
01:36:17.210 --> 01:36:19.645
- Ezra?
<i>- Cold and wet.</i>

1181
01:36:19.690 --> 01:36:20.690
You in there?

1182
01:36:20.770 --> 01:36:23.524
<i>But it burns.</i>

1183
01:36:26.410 --> 01:36:27.924
I'm going in.

1184
01:36:29.370 --> 01:36:33.410
<i>Sucking the life
out of everything.</i>

1185
01:36:35.170 --> 01:36:39.164
<i>It came down in the rock.</i>

1186
01:36:39.210 --> 01:36:41.167
Ezra?

1187
01:36:41.210 --> 01:36:43.167
<i>It lives in the well.</i>

1188
01:36:43.210 --> 01:36:45.486
<i>It grew down there.</i>

1189
01:36:45.530 --> 01:36:47.840
Ezra?

1190
01:36:47.890 --> 01:36:50.883
<i>Poisoning everything.</i>

1191
01:36:53.050 --> 01:36:57.090
<i>Changing everything</i>

1192
01:36:57.130 --> 01:37:00.885
<i>into something like the world
it came from.</i>

1193
01:37:00.930 --> 01:37:06.881
<i>Into what it knows.</i>

1194
01:37:06.930 --> 01:37:12.369
<i>We all know it's coming,
but we can't get away.</i>

1195
01:37:13.650 --> 01:37:18.770
<i>It's got everything
that lives.</i>

1196
01:37:18.810 --> 01:37:22.167
<i>They all drunk the water.</i>

1197
01:37:23.770 --> 01:37:26.604
<i>It got strong.</i>

1198
01:37:26.650 --> 01:37:28.050
Sheriff.

1199
01:37:28.090 --> 01:37:31.242
<i>Fed itself on them.</i>

1200
01:37:32.450 --> 01:37:34.885
<i>It came from the stars...</i>

1201
01:37:34.930 --> 01:37:37.684
Skin's all...

1202
01:37:37.770 --> 01:37:41.650
<i>...where things
ain't like they are here.</i>

1203
01:37:43.570 --> 01:37:46.927
<i>It's just a color.</i>

1204
01:37:46.970 --> 01:37:51.044
<i>But it burns.</i>

1205
01:37:51.090 --> 01:37:57.041
<i>It sucks, and it burns.</i>

1206
01:37:57.090 --> 01:37:58.570
Sheriff!
No! Sheriff!

1207
01:37:59.810 --> 01:38:02.405
<i>It burns.</i>

1208
01:38:06.850 --> 01:38:08.204
Sheriff?

1209
01:38:10.570 --> 01:38:12.050
Sheriff?

1210
01:38:34.250 --> 01:38:35.400
Lavinia?

1211
01:38:37.930 --> 01:38:40.843
It's so beautiful.

1212
01:40:32.890 --> 01:40:34.244
Lavinia!

1213
01:40:55.690 --> 01:40:58.205
<i>No, Jack!</i>

1214
01:40:58.250 --> 01:41:00.481
<i>It's you, Jack.</i>

1215
01:41:00.530 --> 01:41:03.489
<i>Now it's Lavinia.</i>

1216
01:41:03.530 --> 01:41:05.249
<i>There's something wrong
with Jack!</i>

1217
01:41:05.290 --> 01:41:08.362
<i>Why does it matter how far away
it is? Look at him.</i>

1218
01:41:18.770 --> 01:41:22.286
Are you looking
at my legs?

1219
01:41:22.330 --> 01:41:24.049
You're dead, Nathan!

1220
01:41:24.090 --> 01:41:25.809
It's no big deal.

1221
01:41:39.410 --> 01:41:41.163
Don't make... Stay away.

1222
01:41:41.210 --> 01:41:42.210
<i>Daddy!</i>

1223
01:41:51.290 --> 01:41:53.361
No! No!

1224
01:44:44.050 --> 01:44:47.407
<i>I hope the dammed water
that covers this place</i>

1225
01:44:47.450 --> 01:44:49.362
<i>will be very deep.</i>

1226
01:44:50.930 --> 01:44:52.649
<i>But even then...</i>

1227
01:44:55.210 --> 01:44:57.327
<i>...I will never drink it.</i>

1228
01:45:27.130 --> 01:45:31.283
<i>There are only a few of us that
remember the strange days now.</i>

1229
01:45:33.810 --> 01:45:36.882
<i>What touched this place
cannot be quantified</i>

1230
01:45:36.930 --> 01:45:40.082
<i>or understood
by human science.</i>

1231
01:45:47.610 --> 01:45:53.846
<i>It was just a color
out of space...</i>

1232
01:45:55.130 --> 01:46:00.285
<i>...a messenger from realms
whose existence stuns the brain</i>

1233
01:46:00.330 --> 01:46:03.880
<i>and numbs us with the gulfs</i>

1234
01:46:03.930 --> 01:46:07.810
<i>that it throws open
before our frenzied eyes.</i>
